================================================================================
FILE INTEGRITY MONITORING - USER FOLDERS
================================================================================

FILE: fim-config.xml
TARGET: Windows Agent
PURPOSE: Monitor user folders (Downloads, Desktop, Documents) secara realtime
 untuk deteksi file creation, modification, dan deletion

================================================================================
PANDUAN PENGGANTIAN USERNAME
================================================================================

  GANTI 'WINDOWS_USER' DENGAN USERNAME WINDOWS KAMU

  CARA CEK USERNAME:
  - Buka Command Prompt / PowerShell
  - Ketik: echo %USERNAME% atau whoami
  - Hasilnya adalah username Windows kamu

  CONTOH:
  - Username "admin"     → C:\Users\admin\Downloads
  - Username "john"     → C:\Users\john\Downloads
  - Username "laptop-ok" → C:\Users\laptop-ok\Downloads

================================================================================
CARA APPLY CONFIG
================================================================================

1. Edit file di Windows Agent:
   C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf

2. Cari section <syscheck>, GANTI atau TAMBAHKAN dengan config ini

3. GANTI 'WINDOWS_USER' dengan username Windows kamu

4. Restart Agent:
   net stop wazuh-agent
   net start wazuh-agent

   atau via PowerShell (Admin):
   Restart-Service -Name "Wazuh"

================================================================================
CONFIG (UNTUK ossec.conf)
================================================================================

<ossec_config>
  <syscheck>

    <!--
      ========================================================================
      MONITORED DIRECTORIES
      ========================================================================

      GANTI 'WINDOWS_USER' DENGAN USERNAME WINDOWS KAMU!
    -->
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\WINDOWS_USER\Downloads</directories>
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\WINDOWS_USER\Desktop</directories>
    <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes">C:\Users\WINDOWS_USER\Documents</directories>

    <!--
      ========================================================================
      IGNORE PATTERNS
      ========================================================================
      File-file yang TIDAK akan di-monitor

      PATTERN SREGEX:
      - \.tmp$    = File berakhiran .tmp (temporary files)
      - \.log$    = File berakhiran .log (log files)
      - \.crdownload$ = File Chrome temporary saat download
      - \.part$   = File temporary browser (Firefox, dll)
      - \.partial$ = File partial download (IE, Edge)
      - \.temp$   = File berakhiran .temp
      - \.cache$  = File cache
      - \.evtx$   = Windows Event Log files

      CARA SREGEX:
      - $ = akhir string
      - | = OR (atau)
      - \. = literal dot
    -->
    <ignore type="sregex">\.tmp$|\.log$|\.crdownload$|\.part$|\.partial$|\.temp$|\.cache$|\.evtx$</ignore>

    <!--
      ========================================================================
      SCAN FREQUENCY
      ========================================================================
      Interval scan dalam detik (default: 12 jam = 43200 detik)

      PILIH SALAH SATU:
      - 3600      = 1 jam
      - 7200      = 2 jam
      - 21600     = 6 jam
      - 43200     = 12 jam
      - 86400     = 24 jam (1 hari)
    -->
    <frequency>43200</frequency>

    <!-- Scan saat agent start -->
    <scan_on_start>yes</scan_on_start>

    <!-- Ignore file yang tidak berubah setelah alert -->
    <auto_ignore>yes</auto_ignore>

    <!-- Alert untuk file baru -->
    <alert_new_files>yes</alert_new_files>

  </syscheck>
</ossec_config>

================================================================================
PANDUAN ATRIBUT FIM (LENGKAP)
================================================================================

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DIRECTORIES ATTRIBUTES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  realtime="yes"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Monitor perubahan secara real-time menggunakan Windows API
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: no
  Contoh : <directories realtime="yes">C:\Users\ok\Downloads</directories>

  CATATAN:
  - Menggunakan Windows ReadDirectoryChangesW API
  - Tidak bisa deteksi delete dengan sempurna di Windows
  - Butuh Windows Vista atau lebih baru

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  check_all="yes"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Cek semua attribute file yang berubah
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: yes
  Attrib : size, permission, owner, group, md5, sha1, sha256, modification_time

  ATTRIBUTES YANG DICEK (jika check_all="yes"):
  - size          = Ukuran file
  - permission    = Hak akses file
  - owner         = Owner file
  - group         = Group file
  - md5           = MD5 hash
  - sha1          = SHA1 hash
  - sha256        = SHA256 hash
  - mtime         = Modification time
  - inode         = Inode number (Linux only)

  ATTRIBUTES LEBIH SPESIFIK:
  - check_size="yes"    = Cek perubahan ukuran
  - check_perm="yes"    = Cek perubahan permission
  - check_owner="yes"   = Cek perubahan owner
  - check_group="yes"   = Cek perubahan group
  - check_md5sum="yes"  = Cek MD5 hash
  - check_sha1sum="yes" = Cek SHA1 hash
  - check_sha256sum="yes" = Cek SHA256 hash
  - check_mtime="yes"   = Cek modification time

  Contoh:
  <directories check_all="yes" check_md5sum="yes" check_sha256sum="yes">C:\Users\ok\Desktop</directories>

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  recursion_level="N"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Kedalaman scan subfolder
  Nilai  : 0 = tidak ada subfolder, 1 = 1 level, dst
  Default: siblings (sesama level, tidak masuk subfolder)
  Contoh : recursion_level="0" = hanya file di folder utama

  CONTOH:
  - recursion_level="0"    = Hanya folder itu sendiri (tidak masuk subfolder)
  - recursion_level="1"    = Folder + 1 level subfolder
  - recursion_level="2"    = Folder + 2 level subfolder
  - recursion_level="99"   = Deep scan (tidak direkomendasikan)

  WARNING: recursion_level tinggi akan memperlambat scan

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  restrict="pattern"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Filter tipe file yang dimonitor berdasarkan regex
  Nilai  : Regex pattern
  Contoh : restrict="\.exe$" = Hanya file .exe

  CONTOH PATTERN:
  - restrict="\.exe$|\.dll$|\.sys$"  = Hanya .exe, .dll, .sys
  - restrict="\.ps1$"                 = Hanya PowerShell scripts
  - restrict="\.doc$|\.docx$"         = Hanya Word documents
  - restrict="\.pdf$"                  = Hanya PDF files

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  whodata="yes"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Monitor WHO (user) melakukan perubahan
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: no

  BENEFIT:
  - Know siapa yang membuat/mengubah file
  - Know user SID dan username
  - Know process yang membuat file

  REQUIREMENTS:
  - Windows only
  - UAC mungkin perlu dinonaktifkan untuk full visibility
  - More resource intensive

  Contoh:
  <directories check_all="yes" realtime="yes" whodata="yes">C:\Users\ok\Downloads</directories>

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  tags="label1,label2"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Memberi label/kategori untuk filtering di dashboard
  Nilai  : Comma-separated string
  Contoh : tags="critical,startup,malware"

  GUNAA:
  - Filter alerts berdasarkan tag di dashboard
  - Kategorisasi lebih mudah
  - Grouping untuk reporting

  Contoh:
  <directories check_all="yes" tags="user-folders,downloads">C:\Users\ok\Downloads</directories>

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  arch="32" atau arch="64"
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Monitor folder berdasarkan arsitektur Windows
  Nilai  : 32 | 64 | both
  Default: both
  Contoh : arch="64" = Hanya monitor folder 64-bit

  CONTOH:
  - arch="64"   = C:\Windows\System32 (64-bit)
  - arch="32"   = C:\Windows\SysWOW64 (32-bit on 64-bit)
  - arch="both" = Monitor keduanya

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IGNORE PATTERNS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <ignore type="sregex">pattern</ignore>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Ignore file berdasarkan regex pattern
  Type   : sregex = Simple regex

  PATTERN SREGEX:
  - \.tmp$    = File berakhiran .tmp
  - \.log$    = File berakhiran .log
  - \.tmp$|\.log$ = File .tmp atau .log
  - temp      = File mengandung kata "temp"
  - \.tmp$|\.log$|\.cache$

  CATATAN:
  - Simple regex, tidak support full regex
  - Case insensitive
  - $ = akhir string

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <ignore>full_path</ignore>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Ignore path/file tertentu secara literal
  Contoh : <ignore>C:\Windows\System32\config\systemprofile</ignore>

  CONTOH:
  - <ignore>C:\Windows\System32\config</ignore>
  - <ignore>%WINDIR%\System32\config</ignore>
  - <ignore>C:\Users\ok\AppData\Local\Temp</ignore>

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCAN SETTINGS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <frequency>N</frequency>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Interval scan periodic (dalam detik)
  Default: 43200 (12 jam)

  CONTOH:
  - <frequency>3600</frequency>   = 1 jam
  - <frequency>7200</frequency>   = 2 jam
  - <frequency>21600</frequency>  = 6 jam
  - <frequency>43200</frequency>  = 12 jam
  - <frequency>86400</frequency>  = 24 jam

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <scan_on_start>yes</scan_on_start>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Jalankan scan pertama saat agent start
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: yes

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <auto_ignore>yes</auto_ignore>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Ignore file yang sama setelah 3 kali alert
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: yes

  CATATAN:
  - File akan di-ignore setelah unchanged setelah 3 kali scan
  - Tidak berlaku untuk file baru

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <alert_new_files>yes</alert_new_files>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Alert saat ada file baru
  Nilai  : yes | no
  Default: yes

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <process_priority>N</process_priority>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Prioritas proses scan (lower = higher priority)
  Nilai  : -20 to 20
  Default: 10

  CONTOH:
  - process_priority="10"  = Normal priority
  - process_priority="15"  = Lower priority (lebih lambat)
  - process_priority="5"   = Higher priority (lebih cepat, lebih makan resource)

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <max_eps>N</max_eps>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Maximum events per second yang dikirim
  Nilai  : Number
  Default: 50

  GUNAA:
  - Prevent flood ke manager
  - Jika banyak file berubah, events di-queue dan dikirim perlahan

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <windows_audit_interval>N</windows_audit_interval>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Interval cek Windows audit settings (dalam detik)
  Default: 60

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  <synchronization>
    <enabled>yes</enabled>
    <interval>5m</interval>
    <max_eps>10</max_eps>
  </synchronization>
  -----------------------
  Fungsi : Sync database FIM antar agents
  Nilai  : yes | no | interval | max_eps

================================================================================
VERIFIKASI
================================================================================

1. Cek ossec.conf sudah ter-update:
   type "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf"

2. Cek agent terhubung ke Manager:
   Buka Dashboard > Agents > Status: Active

3. Test: Buat file test di folder yang dimonitor
   echo "test" > C:\Users\WINDOWS_USER\Downloads\test.txt

4. Cek alert di Dashboard:
   - Menu: Security Events
   - Filter: rule.id: 554 (file added)
   - Atau cari: syscheck.path: "C:\\Users\\WINDOWS_USER\\Downloads"

================================================================================
RULE IDS UNTUK FILTER
================================================================================

  Rule ID 554 = File added
  Rule ID 550 = File modified
  Rule ID 553 = File deleted
  Rule ID 551 = File integrity changed (hash changed)

================================================================================
TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

Q: File delete tidak terdeteksi?
A: Realtime FIM di Windows tidak bisa deteksi delete dengan sempurna.
   Gunakan scheduled scan (frequency) untuk deteksi delete.

Q: %USERPROFILE% tidak work?
A: Wazuh Agent jalan sebagai SYSTEM account, bukan user biasa.
   Gunakan literal path: C:\Users\USERNAME\Downloads

Q: Alert flood?
A: Kurangi recursion_level atau tambahkan ignore patterns.
   Gunakan max_eps untuk limit events.

Q: Agent tidak start setelah edit config?
A: Cek XML syntax. Pastikan tidak ada karakter khusus.
   Gunakan XML validator online.

